  "notes": [
    "The production kernel and generated composition are both included.",
    "Ranked guest input checks the published Golden Bloom pickup lock before queueing the command.",
    "Historical tests assert the updated costs, hit points, confluence refund and servant cooldown. The waiver policy is unchanged.",
    "The user restored standard contact knockdown for the Terraria servant before release. Its deployment cooldown remains 32 seconds.",
    "The land and aquatic growing graves start at 100 HP and use a 200 HP cap at maturity, preserving the existing doubling rule.",
    "Resumption checks the reviewed source and fixture changes and reruns related plus unfinished modules on the final binaries."
  ]
